SUMMARY:Shojin Ryori Omakase at Dashi in Downtown Durham
DESCRIPTION:$55 five course dinner + $35 pairings \nSome dinners are loud. This one leans a little quieter 🌱🍵 Our June Shojin Ryori Omakase is a five-course vegetarian tasting inspired by traditional Japanese Buddhist cuisine\, built around subtle broths\, seasonal vegetables\, tofu\, mushrooms\, and careful preparation. Finished with matcha kanten and sweet red bean paste for dessert ✨ \nReservations available at our Downtown Durham izakaya at www.dashiramen.com/omakase.\nJapanese Restaurant in Durham\, NC | Downtown Durham Restaurant | Craft Cocktails | Date Night | Vegetarian Menu
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/shojin-ryori-omakase-at-dashi-in-downtown-durham/
LOCATION:Dashi\, 415 E Chapel Hill St.\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:Date Night,Food & Drink
