SUMMARY:Music Trivia Bingo: PRIDE EDITION!
DESCRIPTION:Join us on the last Thursday in June for a very special edition of our weekly Music Trivia Bingo! Stormie Daie and Gay Agenda will have all the Pride music categories for you to enjoy\, and the prizes will be especially fabulous! Come on out and join your community for a fun and flirty night of music and friendly competition 8-10pm. Three rounds\, free to play\, 21+ only.
