SUMMARY:Beginner Stained Glass: Summer Seasonal Theme
DESCRIPTION:This is a three-hour class in which students will learn the basics of the copper foil or “Tiffany” method of creating stained glass. This process includes cutting\, grinding\, foiling\, and soldering individual glass pieces. Students will select one project from our seasonal template selection and take home a finished piece the same day. All materials are included in class pricing. No prior glass experience necessary. \nPlease wear closed-toe shoes and bring something with sleeves!
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/beginner-stained-glass-summer-seasonal-theme/
LOCATION:Fusion Gallery\, 321 W Main St\, Durham\, 27701\, United States
