SUMMARY:Twerk Yoga: Pride Edition! Twisted Yogi x The Velvet Hippo
DESCRIPTION:We’re thrilled to be closing out Pride month by collaborating with Twisted Yogi for her signature Twerk Yoga on our rooftop! Join us for a body-liberation experience blending yoga\, somatic expressions\, and twerk. Created for LGBTQ+ folks and allies\, this space is rooted in safety\, joy\, and unapologetic self-expression. Come as you are. Move how you need. Take up space. ALL BODIES. ALL GENDERS. ALL EXPRESSIONS. \nYoga Mats available. This is a ticketed event with tickets from $3-$33 thanks to a community-supported sliding scale. This space is rooted in care\, access\, and collective support. Choose what you can comfortably pay. If you’re able to give more\, you help make this experience accessible to others. All are welcome.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/twerk-yoga-pride-edition-twisted-yogi-x-the-velvet-hippo/
LOCATION:The Velvet Hippo\, 119 Orange Street\, 3rd Floor\, Durham\, 27701
CATEGORIES:Fitness,LGBTQ,Pride
