SUMMARY:Blazing the Trail AUSL Signature Series
DESCRIPTION:From 5-6 pm on Thursday\, June 25\, join fellow Carolina Blaze fans in downtown Durham for happy hour at participating businesses to try one of their specialty Blaze-inspired food and drink specials before the game. After happy hour\, march from the participating businesses to CCB Plaza at 6pm where we will congregate with Brazilian drummers\, Batalá to “Blaze the Trail” down to Durham Bulls Athletic Park. Stick around to cheer on Carolina Blaze v. the Utah Talons game to kick off the AUSL Signature Series! Kick off the series with Little League Night & Postgame Fireworks presented by GameChanger. The first 500 fans will receive a Blaze Rally Flag giveaway. \nHappy hour spots: \n🔥 E.O.’s Athletic Club \n🔥 Bull McCabe’s Irish Pub \n🔥 Primrose \n🔥 Luna Rotisserie and Taproom \nEnjoy specials at the particpating businesses through June 27th to heat up your pregame plans. \nCheck out our AUSL Signature Series curated itenerary on our Discover Durham app for a look at the route and participating businesses.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/blazing-the-trail-ausl-signature-series/
LOCATION:CCB Plaza\, 201 Corcoran St.\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:Free,Sports
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Untitled-design-30.jpg
