SUMMARY:Summer Concerts in the Park at Forest Park
DESCRIPTION:Join Durham Parks and Recreation for Summer Concerts in the Park\, a FREE\, family-friendly summer concert series that brings the Bull City’s parks to life with live music\, good vibes\, and great food! \nEach concert celebrates the diversity of our City\, presenting emerging local artists with genre-defining talents\,—there’s truly something for everyone to enjoy. Bring a blanket or lawn chair\, gather your crew\, and soak up the sounds of summer in some of Durham’s most beautiful outdoor spaces. \nA rotating lineup of on-site food trucks will be serving up delicious eats throughout the series. \nWhether you’re dancing to the beat or simply enjoying the evening with loved ones\, DPR’s Summer Concerts in the Park is the perfect way to celebrate summer in Durham. \nSeating: Bring your own picnic blanket or chair. No alcohol or smoking allowed. \n**This event is rain or shine
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/summer-concerts-in-the-park-at-forest-park/2026-06-27/
LOCATION:Forest Hills Park\, 1639 University Drive\, Durham\, 27701
CATEGORIES:Concert,Free,Live Performance,Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Summer-Concert-2026-Schedule-1.jpg
