SUMMARY:Comedian Matt Richards
DESCRIPTION:Matt Richards is a New York-based actor\, host\, comedian\, and writer known for his work in film\, television\, and live comedy. He can be seen in the feature film Is This Thing On? with Bradley Cooper and Will Arnett\, the Comedy Central Studios feature film Run For The Money opposite Beck Bennett and Joel McHale on Paramount+\, and as the host of A&E’s popular food travel series Best in Chow. \nHis television credits include Flatbush Misdemeanors\, That Damn Michael Che\, Run The World\, 2 Broke Girls\, School of Rock\, and Bizaardvark. He has also appeared on The Funny Dance Show\, World Star TV\, and The Steve Harvey Show. Richards was selected as a New Face Character at the prestigious Just For Laughs Festival in Montreal and was a standout in the CBS Diversity Showcase.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/comedian-matt-richards/
